cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HeritageGraph in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "HeritageGraph: A Cultural Heritage Linked Open Data Platform"
abstract: >-
  HeritageGraph is a cultural-heritage Linked Open Data platform that lets
  communities contribute, review, and publish knowledge about cultural heritage
  (with a focus on Nepalese heritage) as a CIDOC-CRM knowledge graph, queryable
  over SPARQL and browsable through interactive graph, atlas, and immersive views.
type: software
authors:
